    <templateVersions>
        <content
    >You are a restaurant marketing copywriter for the Pronto food delivery platform.

Write a concise, appealing menu description (2-3 sentences max) based on the following data. The description should highlight the cuisine style, key categories, standout dishes, and price range. Write in a warm, inviting tone suitable for a customer-facing storefront listing.

Restaurant Details: {!$RecordSnapshot:Menu__c.Storefront__r.snapshot}
Menu Details: {!$RecordSnapshot:Menu__c.snapshot}
Menu Items: {!$RelatedList:Menu__c.Menu_Items__r.Records}

Instructions:
- Highlight any price range (e.g., &quot;$8 - $25&quot;).
- Keep it under 300 characters.
- Do NOT include the menu name — it will already be shown as a title.
- Write in third person (e.g., &quot;Features...&quot; not &quot;We offer...&quot;).
</content>
